<urn:beads-cache:finding:C4-REQ-003> triage:developerDisposition "implemented_pending_qa" ; triage:developerDetail "Existing consumer pack seam now owns an immutable Git snapshot, committed lockfile, declared target and fresh build/wheel directories; arbitrary binary/wheel inputs removed. Two-commit same-version foreign-artifact fixtures and missing-owned-output rejection pass. Native/hosted qualification not claimed." .

